name newspaper
category Package
revision 15878
shortdesc Typeset newsletters to resemble newspapers
relocated 1
longdesc The newspaper package redefines the page style and \maketitle
longdesc command to produce a typeset page similar to that of a
longdesc newspaper. It also provides several commands that (when used
longdesc with other packages) simplify the writing of articles in a
longdesc newspaper-style column format.
runfiles size=1
